    "text": "For the estimation of nitrogen, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of an organic compound was digested by the Kjeldahl method and the evolved ammonia was absorbed in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ml</mi></math> of <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>M</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math> sulphuric acid. The unreacted acid required <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ml</mi></math> of <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>M</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math> sodium hydroxide for complete neutralization. The percentage of nitrogen in the compound is",
